    "chunk_text": ", & hie \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m gefeaht Pompeius wi\u00f0 Pincentes \u00fe\u00e6m folce, & hie gefliemde. \u00dea brohton Romane \u00feone triumphan angean Pompeius mid micelre weor\u00fefulnesse for \u00fe\u00e6m lytlan \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m Iulius & Pompeius abr\u00e6can Asculum \u00fea burg on M\u00e6rsum, & \u00fe\u00e6r ofslogon \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m gefeaht Silla se consul wi\u00f0 Somnitum, & heora ofslog eahtatiene M. \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee Romeburg getimbred w\u00e6s VI hunde wintra & LXII, \u00fe\u00e6tte Romane sendon Sillan \u00dea of\u00feuhte \u00fe\u00e6t Mariuse \u00fe\u00e6m consule, Iuliuses eame, \u00fe\u00e6t mon \u00f0\u00e6t gewin nolde him bet\u00e6can. & b\u00e6d \u00fe\u00e6t him mon sealde \u00feone seofo\u00fean consulatum, & eac \u00fe\u00e6t gewin, for \u00feon \u00fee hit w\u00e6s \u00dea Silla geacsade on hwelc gerad Marius com to Rome, he \u00fea hr\u00e6dlice mid ealre his firde wi\u00f0 Ac he fealh \u00fe\u00e6re ilcan niht of \u00fe\u00e6m bendum \u00fee hiene mon on d\u00e6g gebende, & si\u00fe\u00fean fleah su\u00fe Him w\u00e6ron twegen consulas on fultume, Cinna & Sertorius, \u00fea w\u00e6ron simle \u00e6lces yfles & ra\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6s \u00fee \u00fea senatus gehierdon \u00fe\u00e6t Marius to Rome neal\u00e6cte, hie ealle ut aflugon on Creca \u00dea w\u00e6s Silla mid micelre geornfulnisse f\u00e6rende of Crecum wi\u00fe Rome weard, & wi\u00f0 Marius Ra\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6s ealle \u00fea consulas w\u00e6ron deade buton tw\u00e6m. Marius & Silla geforan him self, & Cinna w\u00e6s ofslagen on Smyrna, Asia byrg,",
